ttps:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=29493"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":29236,"date":"2025-08-06T09:27:10","date_gmt":"2025-08-06T13:27:10","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=29236"},"modified":"2025-08-06T10:17:11","modified_gmt":"2025-08-06T14:17:11","slug":"paypal-us-clients","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/paypal-us-clients","title":{"rendered":"PayPal funding is here for U.S. clients!"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We\u2019ve got some exciting news to make your crypto journey even smoother: <strong>PayPal is now a funding option for Kraken clients in the U.S.<\/strong> That means you can deposit USD and start trading in just a few taps \u2014 no wires, no wait and definitely no bank logins.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-if-you-use-paypal-you-re-already-halfway-there\"><strong>If you use PayPal, you&#8217;re already halfway there<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Chances are, you\u2019ve used PayPal before \u2014 to shop online, send a friend some cash or maybe split dinner. Now, you can use that same PayPal account to fund your Kraken wallet instantly. Whether you prefer using your PayPal balance, linked bank account or card, it&#8217;s all good to go.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">No more typing in your bank credentials. No third-party login pop-ups. Just fast, familiar funding from a platform you already trust.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-why-paypal\"><strong>Why PayPal?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Because it just works.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Adding PayPal as a deposit method is part of our mission to make crypto easier for everyone \u2014 especially if you\u2019re new or just crypto-curious. With <strong>instant deposits available 24\/7<\/strong>, you can jump into the market when the moment feels right without getting stuck in banking delays.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It\u2019s secure. It\u2019s intuitive. It\u2019s kind of a no-brainer if you&#8217;re already using PayPal day-to-day.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-the-u-s-joins-the-eu-u-k-and-australia-and-we-re-not-done\"><strong>The U.S. joins the EU, U.K. and Australia\u2026 and we\u2019re not done<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This isn\u2019t PayPal\u2019s first crypto rodeo. Kraken clients in the <strong>EU, U.K. and Australia<\/strong> have already been enjoying this feature and now it\u2019s your turn, U.S. More countries coming soon.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Fun fact<\/strong>: During our soft launch, clients moved over <strong>$1 million<\/strong> through PayPal deposits. And that was without a single marketing push. Just word of mouth and a lot of happy users.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-what-happens-after-you-deposit\"><strong>What happens after you deposit?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">That\u2019s when the real fun starts. Once your USD is in your Kraken account, you can:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Trade <strong>400+ cryptocurrencies<br><\/strong><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Use <strong>Kraken Pro<\/strong> for advanced features or the <strong>Kraken App<\/strong> for crypto on the go<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Stake<\/strong>, earn rewards or send money using <strong>Kraken Pay<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">No friction. No delays.&nbsp; Just possibilities.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-ready-to-get-started\"><strong>Ready to get started?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Funding with PayPal only takes a few minutes. Log in, choose PayPal at checkout and you\u2019re off to the races.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/sign-up\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get Started with Kraken and fund with PayPal<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Geographic restrictions apply. Projected annual rate is an estimate based on the average staking rewards accrued over the past period, before commission, and is subject to change.&nbsp; Staking involves risks including no guarantee of rewards, potential loss from slashing or hacks, and depreciation in the value of assets while staked. Please refer to Kraken&#8217;s <\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/legal\"><em>Terms of Service for additional information.<\/em><\/a><em>&nbsp;<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We\u2019ve got some exciting news to make your crypto journey even smoother: PayPal is now a funding option for Kraken clients in the U.S. That means you can deposit USD and start trading in just a few taps \u2014 no wires, no wait and definitely no bank logins. If you use PayPal, you&#8217;re already halfway [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":230089386,"featured_media":29257,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1790,1774],"tags":[1373,1517],"language":[],"class_list":["post-29236","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-new-features","category-news","tag-featured","tag-funding"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>PayPal funding is here for U.S. clients! - Kraken Blog<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/paypal-us-clients\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"PayPal funding is here for U.S. clients!\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"We\u2019ve got some exciting news to make your crypto journey even smoother: PayPal is now a funding option for Kraken clients in the U.S. That means you can deposit USD and start trading in just a few taps \u2014 no wires, no wait and definitely no bank logins. If you use PayPal, you&#8217;re already halfway [&hellip;]\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/news\/paypal-us-clients\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Kraken Blog\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-08-06T13:27:10+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-08-06T14:17:11+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Paypal-Blog@2x-1.png\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"3070\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"1400\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/png\" \/>\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"KrakenFX\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content